### CSV 格式示例
```csv
id,user_code,user_first_name,user_last_name,user_email,created_time
1,john_doe,John,Doe,john@example.com,2025-01-15 10:30:00
2,jane_smith,Jane,Smith,jane@example.com,2025-01-16 14:20:00
```

### JSON 格式示例
```json
{
  "metadata": {
    "database": "sys_db",
    "query": "SELECT * FROM sm_user LIMIT 10",
    "rowCount": 2,
    "exportedAt": "2025-08-05T14:30:22",
    "columns": [
      {"name": "id", "dataType": "integer"},
      {"name": "user_code", "dataType": "varchar"}
    ]
  },
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "user_code": "john_doe",
      "user_first_name": "John",
      "user_last_name": "Doe"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "user_code": "jane_smith",
      "user_first_name": "Jane",
      "user_last_name": "Smith"
    }
  ]
}
```

